{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n\n<p>發佈時間：12:00 2026-11-21 HKT</p>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩宣布離巢 台慶穿畢業袍告別11年情 跳出舒適圈與工作量減少無關：下個舞台見\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl_square/17e77c33efc70a4450fbcd3a48402295/2026-11/KF_53.jpg\"/>\n<p>2015年香港小姐「友誼小姐」得主林凱恩（Iris），前晚（19日）出席《萬千星輝賀台慶》時，帶同私人攝影師到場，又穿上畢業袍在台慶佈景板前照片，期間更拋起四方帽，充滿儀式感宣布離巢TVB。林凱恩今日（21日）在IG上載影片並留言：「台慶快樂，我畢業了。感謝我的青春製作組，下個舞台，見。」</p>\n<h2>林凱恩派「散水餅」感謝台前幕後</h2>\n<p>林凱恩當晚穿上綴滿珍珠與閃石的白色晚裝，並戴上水晶頭飾，打扮有如女神。林凱恩向傳媒透露，準備「散水餅」答謝一眾共事多年的台前幕後。林凱恩指當日相信是自己最後一次過TVB生日，非常感恩在過去11年間遇上充滿愛的朋友，趁台慶向大家表達謝意。</p>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在今年台慶，帶同裝備齊全的私人攝影師到場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/3985f56688764916d72d954bd0dbb4c2/2026-11/Image_4_3.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"私人攝影師孭住兩支攝影補光燈，為林凱恩拍照。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/d9138ebc41820ee228e282db3879cfa9/2026-11/Image_6_2.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在中段返回紅地氈影相留念。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6c9eb90843a60d77d372c5a133af147f/2026-11/Image_25_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩穿上畢業袍影相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a0207c47fd7c2d6c607b8025c12e55c9/2026-11/Image_26_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩離巢工作11年的TVB。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/50a5cb0f74fae4c7bc62f30d69bc32dc/2026-11/Image_27_1.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩今日（21日）在IG上載影片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/deff75be3c69a1b04e51b2e20fc6c443/2026-11/IRIS_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩表示：「台慶快樂，我畢業了。感謝我的青春製作組，下個舞台，見。」\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/857f09329c935a248cf4008849d2e867/2026-11/IRIS_3_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩獲家人支持離巢決定。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3c20283dce50b1aefc8ca875dd2e35fa/2026-11/LAM_2_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩被爆有秘密男友。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e4d97c63410e5e299218ef41b11accb/2024-12/467742591_18466232437044094_9034007416623802047_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾傳婚期近。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ccb6b1b1bdca38faeeedef9679831536/2024-12/467662111_18466232425044094_430511203283638878_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩狂ig狂吸fans。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a0e9dfc258fd899915a13a4a4aa585bc/2022-12/IRISLAM26.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩好sweet。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/27df1d385cdd29c80963fcf4e0960952/2022-12/IRISLAM23.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩經常分享靚相。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/94a13279602c2d924f653dae9010571c/2022-12/IRISLAM20.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩身材姣好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/254af53b817f783e8632237093530ccd/2022-12/IRISLAM19.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩有唔少fans。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5b0abe831a02a7d52f0053ab50c92ec5/2022-12/IRISLAM13.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩身材好好。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/05bffd0c9c314df7b47e5bd957fcb197/2022-12/IRISLAM11.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾分享慶祝生日的照片。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/43d58933755219f36f99e17ba19127eb/2024-08/Photo_shared_by_on_August_20_2024_tagging_bbbakeaboo_May_be_an_image_of_1_person_flower_arrangement_candle_balloon_prairie_gentian_baby_s-breath_white_lily_rose_and_text_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在廠景主持廚藝環節。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/7721e719dc45c25ec2c4843f513c87b0/2022-10/new%20%286%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩唔跟前輩著短裙騷長腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/acbf9b8f31a85c5442ee5696616ea1ea/2023-03/photo1678858171.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩經常穿長裙上陣。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/01848f91d975d543a81e0c27592dba34/2023-03/photo1678858171%20%282%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩穿長褲收起美腿。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a692373ba65252091864facd419e2155/2023-03/photo1678858171%20%283%29.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩是美腿之人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/d9e94c3c3d3e882a5959f1e575219bdf/2023-03/iris_lammm_130870491_225158235688143_1451280700996951648_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩笑容甜美。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fb841a1211a305e46543b00a82c2441b/2022-12/IRISLAM27.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾到希臘旅行，晒罕見性感。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/aa7ff603494905d716506a39453f8ce4/2024-12/466161929_18464041936044094_3185764997670799864_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩大露背非常吸引。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ab8398398bfb3ad02eadcc8219cc5af5/2024-12/466156469_18464041924044094_2418472987293910677_n.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩露胸前春光。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fe8c03ff0856f7e56e80a9870ae0555c/2024-12/466146566_18464041915044094_1165099853252162032_n.jpg\"/>\n<h2>林凱恩告別《愛．回家》Bonnie</h2>\n<p>林凱恩入行以來，憑處境劇《愛．回家之開心速遞》中飾演「Bonnie譚育英」一角成功入屋。提到離巢一事，林凱恩稱一切都是命運的安排。林凱恩由衷感激TVB多年來的栽培，不論是綜藝還是戲劇，都林凱恩發掘到自己的表演潛能，並期盼未來不論以何種形式，都能繼續陪伴觀眾。</p>\n<p>對於離巢決定，林凱恩透露未有糾結太久，僅僅考慮三、四天便下定決心，又透露TVB曾有意挽留，但林凱恩自覺在舒適圈待得太久，想跳出去看看外面的世界，並獲得家人支持，認為林凱恩過去被保護得太好，出去闖一闖也無妨，只要林凱恩開心就好。</p>\n<h2>林凱恩無合約一身輕計劃放長假</h2>\n<p>林凱恩又補充離巢與工作量減少無關，接下來會給自己放一個悠長的假期：「可以去多啲旅行，我都好開心亦都好想知道，自己一個人之後可以睇到幾多嘢。最鍾意去旅行，向來都好鍾意。甚至可能環遊世界。」</p>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩憑住《 愛．回家》的清純形象成功入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5ba1c68e5713ffb249136e96a6109e2a/2022-10/IG%20%285%29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩在《愛．回家》飾演「譚道德」的女兒Bonnie。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/fa225fb34cf25c028b3785a558dc5d18/2022-10/lovegohome%20%281%29_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩與周嘉洛在《愛．回家之開心速遞》中，被網民視為一對。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/b5855b7e0be9faa2082ba19e3fba57f4/2023-08/002_24.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩因拍攝《愛·回家之開心速遞》演「Bonnie」一角入屋。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/5e68cd17744df3cc716ec262d0cf76d2/2023-11/VS---myTVSUPER-1_14_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩與「金城安」周嘉洛這對螢幕CP很受大眾歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3fe75e8b9c3e20452154c01a590a04ae/2023-11/VS---myTVSUPER-2_12_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"「安Bon」CP深受粉絲歡迎。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3b94bf8625cfffe07151b766960c4c2b/2022-10/1_21.png\"/>\n<img alt=\" 周嘉洛離開劇組，林凱恩拍有新情侶拍檔，與丘梓謙組成「蔥Bon」CP。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f39407fbeb50317f58ab4d985959b3cc/2022-10/4_15.png\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾在《她她她的少女時代》中大騷驕人上圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/41fa325d704a8025c5d28ccb0c00c31c/2023-03/d7718d44-a3d9-4306-89cc-f20c8470c3b2_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾在《她她她的少女時代》中大騷驕人上圍。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3014d8d2bf2bb8ffef6ed19c36641e76/2023-03/08b0056f-4b38-4919-bc08-e2f15069a93a_1024.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾捲入一間餐廳的出糧糾紛。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/c0dd16be3c2621203320fd14c0ff5bf4/2022-12/IRISLAM29.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩被《東周刊》爆在尖沙咀開設餐廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/ff71b979918b2bc4d090e5747bee88db/2024-01/fennel_tst_1655020182_2858838951640472402_49142830180.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩被《東周刊》拍到疑獲餐廳年輕廚師接收工。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/778ef1bfad868684aa6cd97152cffed1/2024-01/1060_BBC_05.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"餐廳的景觀開揚，更可看到維港煙花，位置不錯。（《東周刊》圖片）\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f4585a532e3476664538fd7b9377db09/2024-01/1060_BBC_08.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"據知餐廳融合泰國料理及西餐的fushion菜，主打海鮮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/e5dfca8401b32e03ea7cf0bd100b480d/2024-01/fennel_tst_1704526775_3274130359273044260_49142830180.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"據知餐廳融合泰國料理及西餐的fushion菜，主打海鮮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bbbfab2206afb5eb464b32754f3096ee/2024-01/fennel_tst_1704526775_3274130359373743874_49142830180.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"亦有半自助餐及自助沙律吧供應。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/6df2ce536d337add86b4a740edd75561/2024-01/fennel_tst_1704526775_3274130359423992148_49142830180.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾帶好姊妹郭嘉文及鄺潔楹到店內用餐，並拍照上載IG。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8288777e3c54441e3c10525e42bd4e4a/2024-01/iris_lammm_1686208649_3120466778547659446_196780093_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩與郭嘉文、鄺潔楹到餐廳聚會。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/4d091ffe4753bd1412c4dfe6427a1d9f/2024-01/iris_lammm_1686208649_3120466778556134907_196780093_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩被爆每周到餐廳試菜及埋數，更會吩咐員工注意事項。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d31a656a4a41835a532f29c723e303d/2024-01/iris_lammm_1686208649_3120466778707085627_196780093_1_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"林凱恩曾帶媽媽到餐廳慶祝生日。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/79f9833c4a27d4d84c87940acc5ad781/2024-01/iris_lammm_1689934090_3151718041306044059_196780093.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"曾有傳林凱恩的男友拖欠多名員工薪金，涉及金額近50萬元。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/8ec9f6716b6f5a9be0d68c4997de0948/2024-01/iris_lammm_1689934090_3151718041306077315_196780093.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有報道指，餐廳老闆Vincent是林凱恩男友，與男方任職小學校長的父親開設。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3037cf16b25aba13fbbb68699413159d/2024-01/VS--irislammmInstagramphotosandvideos-0_03_.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"YouTube上有不少KOL介紹該餐廳。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3d29fb8240d97397e9bc6f4abcf28ff4/2024-01/1706538295413.jpeg\"/>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-21T07:43:49.973327+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":677,"images":50,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-21T04:00:42+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T07:57:31.606647+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-21T07:37:24.279336+00:00","content_hash":"c2efd293a527c264905a17a3f05103032e33caf5caa5c76c5772d1fd7c9e0647","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}